726
00:47:13,289 --> 00:47:17,585
Lalu Baghdad, dan akhirnya, misi di Kabul.

727
00:47:17,710 --> 00:47:19,170
Benar.

728
00:47:19,295 --> 00:47:20,895
Ada beberapa pertanyaan tentang pengunduran dirinya

729
00:47:20,922 --> 00:47:22,006
