734
00:47:27,554 --> 00:47:29,389
- Ya. - Alasan kesehatan.

735
00:47:29,806 --> 00:47:31,099
Coba kamu perhatikan itu, ya, Ray?

736
00:47:31,224 --> 00:47:32,600
Itulah hal semacam itu

737
00:47:32,725 --> 00:47:34,018
